1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,540
Read a funny A1 story about trying something new.

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:09,480
Follow the story scenes, answer simple questions, and then act the gym role play with a partner.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,280
This is a short school story.

4
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,240
Mr. Ping Pong is good at table tennis.

5
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:18,420
He likes to win, and he talks like a champion.

6
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,740
But one day, the class uses a big jump rope.

7
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:29,400
Mr. Ping Pong learns that a new thing can be hard at first.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Key Idea.

9
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,820
Read each scene first.

10
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:38,960
When you see the role play, choose two roles and act it with a partner.

11
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,700
Warm-Up Questions.

12
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,740
What sport or game are you good at?

13
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:51,220
Is it easy to try a new thing in front of people?

14
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:55,080
What can you say when a friend needs help?

15
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:56,560
Gym practice

16
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:57,740
Are you ready?

17
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:58,980
Yes.

18
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,040
I can do this.

19
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:01,460
Watch the rope.

20
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:02,880
Listen to the beat.

21
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,320
It looks fast.

22
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,760
Do not rush.

23
00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:06,720
Wait.

24
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:07,440
Okay.

25
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:08,880
Tell me when.

26
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:09,600
Now.

27
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:10,380
Jump.

28
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:12,060
I did it!

29
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,180
Good job.

30
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:14,480
Try two more jumps.

31
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:15,580
One.

32
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:16,780
Two.

33
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:19,660
This is hard, but it is fun.

34
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:20,920
Do you want the ball too?

35
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,340
Yes.

36
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,680
Throw it softly, please.

37
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:25,040
Here it comes.

38
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,340
Tap.

39
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:27,280
Wow.

40
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:28,780
I can jump and hit.

41
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:30,240
You have good timing.

42
00:01:30,940 --> 00:01:31,640
Thank you.

43
00:01:31,660 --> 00:01:32,500
Your help was good too.

44
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:40,240
Mr. Ping Pong is proud, funny, and sometimes difficult.

45
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,240
But he can change a little.

46
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:45,140
At first, he laughs at the big rope.

47
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:52,760
Then he misses, listens, tries again, and accepts help.

48
00:01:53,660 --> 00:02:00,400
The story teaches a simple lesson: a new thing can feel scary, but practice and help make it easier.

49
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:03,080
You do not have to be perfect on the first try.

50
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:04,640
Good work.

51
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:12,220
Ask one clear question, repeat the important words, and move when your next step is clear.
